Package: soryos-pop-compat
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SoryOS Team <maintainers@soryos.local>
Depends: soryos-fonts, soryos-appstream-data, soryos-sound-theme
Provides: pop-fonts, appstream-data-pop, pop-sound-theme
Description: SoryOS compatibility aliases for legacy Pop package names
 Transitional metapackage so COSMIC packages built against Pop names
 resolve on SoryOS until their Depends fields are renamed upstream.
